The Hon'ble Appellate court has held thus;
(A) MOTOR VEHICLES ACT, 1988 - SECTION 173(1)
- COMPENSATION - METHOD OF COMPUTATION- OF - HELD - Law contemplates two categories of damages on the death of a person - The first is the pecuniary loss sustained by the dependent members of his family - The second is the loss caused to the estate of the deceased-
